"Flask","React","Docker"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/ats-engine","external":null},"html":"<p>An AI-powered resume screener that scores a resume against a software engineering job description out of 100, explains every point and ranks fixes by estimated gain. Claude extracts the JD and resume into structured JSON and judges rubrics with quoted evidence, while deterministic Python does all the scoring. It runs a skill gate, an 8-dimension fit breakdown and integrity checks for hidden text and keyword stuffing, and caches LLM calls so re-scoring stays stable.</p>"},{"frontmatter":{"title":"hatErase","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/srijansingh53.github.io/static/b50e64a1d122e6cecf7f7e8d6016c2ec/1cfc0/tracks.png","srcSet":"/srijansingh53.github.io/static/b50e64a1d122e6cecf7f7e8d6016c2ec/e20c6/tracks.png 300w,\n/srijansingh53.github.io/static/b50e64a1d122e6cecf7f7e8d6016c2ec/62ea7/tracks.png 600w,\n/srijansingh53.github.io/static/b50e64a1d122e6cecf7f7e8d6016c2ec/1cfc0/tracks.png 1200w","sizes":"(min-width: 1200px) 1200px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/srijansingh53.github.io/static/b50e64a1d122e6cecf7f7e8d6016c2ec/b979a/tracks.webp 300w,\n/srijansingh53.github.io/static/b50e64a1d122e6cecf7f7e8d6016c2ec/2fa07/tracks.webp 600w,\n/srijansingh53.github.io/static/b50e64a1d122e6cecf7f7e8d6016c2ec/fa3be/tracks.webp 1200w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1200px) 1200px, 100vw"}]},"width":1200,"height":599}}},"tech":["NLTK","Django","Twitter Dev API","Python","AWS"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/hatErase","external":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/hatErase"},"html":"<p>A web application to track and abjure hate speech on Twitter in real-time. Trained an NLP classification model to\ndetect hate and notify the user through mail about the tracked person whenever the handler tweets a hateful tweet.</p>"},{"frontmatter":{"title":"traXee","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/srijansingh53.github.io/static/ed532f17feea3a924ea5ff138e34f95b/a4050/history.jpg","srcSet":"/srijansingh53.github.io/static/ed532f17feea3a924ea5ff138e34f95b/646aa/history.jpg 300w,\n/srijansingh53.github.io/static/ed532f17feea3a924ea5ff138e34f95b/f4c56/history.jpg 600w,\n/srijansingh53.github.io/static/ed532f17feea3a924ea5ff138e34f95b/a4050/history.jpg 1200w","sizes":"(min-width: 1200px) 1200px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/srijansingh53.github.io/static/ed532f17feea3a924ea5ff138e34f95b/6c117/history.webp 300w,\n/srijansingh53.github.io/static/ed532f17feea3a924ea5ff138e34f95b/6ad45/history.webp 600w,\n/srijansingh53.github.io/static/ed532f17feea3a924ea5ff138e34f95b/f09d5/history.webp 1200w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1200px) 1200px, 100vw"}]},"width":1200,"height":616}}},"tech":["Django","Redis","Celery","Flipkart Affliate API","AWS"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/traxee","external":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/traxee"},"html":"<p>A web app as a personalized Smart E-Commerce Product Tracking Tool. Designed a robust software that enables a user to track price movements of their favorite products on a popular eCommerce Platform through a web-interface.</p>"}]},"projects":{"nodes":[{"frontmatter":{"title":"atithi","tech":["MindMeld Conversational API","BeautifulSoup","ElasticSearch","Azure VM","Twilio"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/atithi","external":"https://medium.com/mindmeld/conversational-ai-at-smart-india-hackathon-2020-1793dfa0b574#SIH2020","company":"SIH 2020"},"html":"<p>A virtual conversational assistant for tourism in India integrated with Whatsapp. Shortisted in Finale of SIH 2020 Software Edition. Read more about it on <a href=\"https://medium.com/mindmeld/conversational-ai-at-smart-india-hackathon-2020-1793dfa0b574#SIH2020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Medium Post</a>.</p>"},{"frontmatter":{"title":"Mammohance","tech":["OpenCV","SKkImage","Google Colab","Python"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/MammoHance","external":"","company":""},"html":"<p>Code Implementation of a paper on Adaptive Mammographic Image Enhancement. The goal of the project was to enhance the breast mammographic images so as to ease the detection of micro-calcifications or granular masses that may be malignant.</p>"},{"frontmatter":{"title":"FORID - Field Orbiting robot to Identify Disease","tech":["Flask","Raspberry Pi","Keras","OpenCV","SQL"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/FORID-Build-4-India","external":"","company":"BFDI 2020"},"html":"<p>A robot to orbit around the field and map diseased areas. An Android App to display the map and send the data on the cloud. Shortislted for the Google Build For Digital India Regionals.</p>"},{"frontmatter":{"title":"Twitter Sentiment Analysis","tech":["Next.js","Tailwind CSS","Firebase"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/Twitter-Sentiment-Analysis","external":"","company":""},"html":"<p>Sentiment Analysis and classification using NLP techniques on Twitter dataset. It was a part of a challenge on Analytics Vidhya in which I secured in top 50 of the leaderboard.</p>"},{"frontmatter":{"title":"Neuralifer","tech":["OpenCV","Keras","Google Colab"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/Neural-Style-Transfer","external":"","company":""},"html":"<p>Generation of artistic images using Style Transfer.</p>"},{"frontmatter":{"title":"Semantic-Segemtation-of-CXR","tech":["Keras","OpenCV","Python"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/Semantic-Segemtation-of-CXR","external":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/Semantic-Segemtation-of-CXR","company":""},"html":"<p>A Segmantic segmentation of lung fields in chest X-rays using U-net (a network of UpSampling in convolutions)</p>"},{"frontmatter":{"title":"Spam Identifier Website","tech":["NLTK","SKLearn","NodeJS"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/Spam-Identifier-Website","external":"","company":""},"html":"<p>A web application deployed on Node.js to classify spam/non-spam messages using Multinomial Naive Bayes algorithm.</p>"},{"frontmatter":{"title":"Multi-Material-layer-Absorbtion-of-Radiowaves","tech":["Matlab","Optimization ToolBox"],"github":"https://github.com/srijansingh53/Multi-Material-layer-Absorbtion-of-Radiowaves","external":"","company":null},"html":"<p>Optimization of different parameters for 4 different materials as layers so as to absorb radio-waves in X-Band.</p>"}]}},"pageContext":{}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}